@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:她的身上看起来没有伤……|#0102Adv06_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜……我反应太大了，好丢人……|#0102Adv06_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一行人把要死要活的米莉亚<br>带到了医务室。|#0102Adv06_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露和安安也在医务室里面。<br>她们两个仿佛已成了医务室的固定出场人员。|#0102Adv06_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚激动得快要哭出来，<br>梅露露只好拼命安抚她。|#0102Adv06_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR8
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我总是拖大家的后腿，好丢脸……<br>都怪我，小沙也被吓跑了。|#0102Adv06_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那不是大叔你的错！<br>啊，不小心叫你大叔了。|#0102Adv06_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:随你怎么喊都好了……|#0102Adv06_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:感觉和米莉亚在一起的时候，心情都没那么紧张了。<br>某种意义上来说，她也算是治愈系角色呢。|#0102Adv06_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是啊，逃跑的时候她大吵大闹的，<br>我都有点被她逗笑了……|#0102Adv06_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:不对不对，刚刚的情况很危险啊！|#0102Adv06_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜……对不起，给你们添麻烦了……|#0102Adv06_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一边苦笑<br>一边回想起刚才发生的事。|#0102Adv06_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（奈叶香狙击了米莉亚。<br>　她们已经没法重归于好了吗……）|#0102Adv06_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香对米莉亚表现出了明确的杀意。<br>艾玛感受不到奈叶香愿意和解<br>并协助计划的希望。|#0102Adv06_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……我觉得，还是应该找奈叶香谈谈。<br>　还有亚里沙也是。<br>　大家一定能相互理解的……现在还来得及）|#0102Adv06_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙小姐是怎么说的……？|#0102Adv06_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露给大家泡好香草茶端了过来，<br>正好问到这件事。|#0102Adv06_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:她说自己做不到，<br>不过我觉得，和她谈一谈的话总会有办法的。|#0102Adv06_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毕竟，大家都是一心想逃出这里的……<br>既然亚里沙是这个计划的关键，<br>我一定会说服她！|#0102Adv06_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来这件事<br>只能拜托艾玛你了。|#0102Adv06_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:她应该不会对大叔我敞开心扉啦……|#0102Adv06_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

