@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:（安安刚才在看我……？）|#0102Adv06_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，你身体怎么样了？|#0102Adv06_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听到艾玛问话，<br>安安一下子扭过头去。|#0102Adv06_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，米莉亚走到安安身边。|#0102Adv06_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，一直躺在这里很无聊吧？<br>要不要和大叔我去看电影啊？|#0102Adv06_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………嗯。|#0102Adv06_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（什么……！？）|#0102Adv06_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:安安乖乖下了床，<br>慢悠悠地跟在米莉亚身后。|#0102Adv06_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看样子，两人去了娱乐室。|#0102Adv06_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:……不是吧，米莉亚<br>到底是怎么驯服安安的？|#0102Adv06_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是啊，真是个出乎意料的组合……|#0102Adv06_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自从上次她们一起来医务室以后<br>好像很聊得来……|#0102Adv06_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可能因为米莉亚小姐是年长者，<br>安安对她比较放心吧。|#0102Adv06_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:哦，类似于监护人的角色吗？|#0102Adv06_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚人很好呢。|#0102Adv06_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（看来她应该真的不是幕后黑手）|#0102Adv06_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚和安安有说有笑地离开了。<br>光是看到两个人关系很好的样子，艾玛的脸上也灿烂了起来。|#0102Adv06_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:好！休息时间结束！<br>我去找找看亚里沙。|#0102Adv06_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不要太勉强自己哦……？<br>要是累了就休息一下吧。|#0102Adv06_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那，我和梅露露<br>去玛格的房间一趟咯？|#0102Adv06_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:热气球的制作地点<br>在玛格的牢房。|#0102Adv06_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在汉娜肯定在<br>一刻不停地拼命缝制吧。|#0102Adv06_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，我也想帮上大家的忙……！|#0102Adv06_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:说起来，她们之前叫我不要过去耶。<br>说我只会碍手碍脚，太过分了！|#0102Adv06_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊哈哈……|#0102Adv06_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不禁苦笑起来。|#0102Adv06_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然途中有些挫折，<br>　但我第一次感受到了成功越狱的希望）|#0102Adv06_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（热气球在一步步地接近完工……<br>　就差一点了。我们一定可以——）|#0102Adv06_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:难掩心中兴奋的艾玛<br>一步一跳地离开了医务室。|#0102Adv06_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

